`matAt x 45`, `matAt x 36` and `(x 54, x 55)` are a weak fit of `Other.SquareTrapezohedron.polyhedron` scaled
by `N` through itself. -/
theorem trapezohedronSquareTrapezohedron_pose_of_reps {N : ℝ} (h : PolynomialSystem.IsRootEq [Pose.TrapezohedronSquareTrapezohedron.reps0] N) :
    PolynomialSystem.IsPoseRoot Other.SquareTrapezohedron.polyhedron Pose.TrapezohedronSquareTrapezohedron.S N 45 36 54 := by
  rw [Pose.TrapezohedronSquareTrapezohedron.S_eq]
  exact PolynomialSystem.ct_isPoseRoot h List.mem_cons_self Pose.TrapezohedronSquareTrapezohedron.len_eq Pose.TrapezohedronSquareTrapezohedron.reps_eq
    (Root.ParData.theta_spec Nieuwland.Polyhedra.TrapezohedronSquareTrapezohedronDim.root) Pose.TrapezohedronSquareTrapezohedron.par_ok Pose.TrapezohedronSquareTrapezohedron.zs_eq Pose.TrapezohedronSquareTrapezohedron.weak_ok Pose.TrapezohedronSquareTrapezohedron.poly_eq Pose.TrapezohedronSquareTrapezohedron.ok

end Nieuwland.Polyhedra
